Description: AMWA IS-05 NMOS Device Connection Management reference implementation, with MXL sender/receiver transport support added
 nmoscommon, mediatimestamp, and nodefacade (setup.py's own
 install_requires) are PyPI-only packages, not apt packages under any
 name - dpkg can never treat them as satisfied, so they are deliberately
 NOT listed here. Install them after this package with:
 .
   sudo pip3 install --break-system-packages nmoscommon mediatimestamp nodefacade
